  "prefLabel": "Mtec 103.04 Records Not Subject to Disclosure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mtec 103.04 Records Not Subject to Disclosure.\n\n(a) The board, and the office of professional licensure and certification shall deny requests to access the following board records:\n\n(1) Minutes of non-public sessions, only if sealed by vote of the board pursuant to RSA 91-A:3, III;\n\n(2) Governmental records exempt from disclosure under RSA 91-A:5;\n\n(3) The office records of any client or patient who receives services from a registrant.\n\n(b) Notwithstanding the provisions of (a) above, the board and the office of professional licensure and certification shall disclose board records in accordance with the order of a court of competent jurisdiction.\n\nSource. #11091-A, eff 5-5-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mtec100.html"
